{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Harness melee hit bonus makes every Hamstring of a fixture striker land on a Witch Doctor",
  "contract": [
    "ADR 1049 (provisional) adds the creature fixture field melee_hit_bonus, which sets m_modMeleeHitChance.",
    "Hamstring 1715 is DmgClass 2 (melee): Unit::SpellHitResult sends it to MeleeSpellHitResult, whose miss",
    "chance (MeleeSpellMissChance) starts near 5% against a level 60 player and subtracts only the attacker's",
    "m_modMeleeHitChance; spell_hit_bonus (m_modSpellHitChance) does not reach it. The striker carries",
    "melee_hit_bonus 100 and the caster's dodge and parry are forced to 0 before every attempt (no shield, so",
    "no block). Each of 60 triggered Hamstring casts must land (the snare 1715 on the caster, removed before",
    "the next attempt); without the bonus all 60 land with probability 0.95^60, about 5%."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 120000,
  "players": [
    {
      "id": "doctor",
      "race": 1,
      "class": 13,
      "level": 60
    }
  ],
  "creatures": [
    {
      "id": "striker",
      "owner": "doctor",
      "entry": 36,
      "level": 60,
      "health": 1000000,
      "distance": 3,
      "reaction": 1,
      "melee_hit_bonus": 100
    }
  ],
